OL,3,GNEWSABoys rescued after rising tide
OL,4,Acuts them off
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree boys have been rescued after
OL,7,Fgetting cut off in caves by a rising
OL,8,Ftide on the East Yorkshire coast.
OL,10,FThe RNLI crew at Flamborough were
OL,11,Fcalled in to help a Coastguard
OL,12,Fhelicopter at Thornwick Bay on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FIn a social media post, the lifeboat
OL,16,Fcharity said: "Two casualties were
OL,17,Fclinging to a rock at the bottom of the
OL,18,Fcliffs, a third casualty was further
OL,19,Fout in the water."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
