OL,3,GNEWSABoys rescued after rising tide
OL,4,Acuts them off
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boy in the water was rescued by the
OL,7,Flifeboat before being winched up by the
OL,8,Fhelicopter to the cliff tops for urgent
OL,9,Fmedical attention.
